<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Transfer Certificate</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: "Times New Roman", serif; margin: 40px; text-align: center; }
    .logo img { width: 100px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .university { font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #002147; }
    .title { font-size: 20px; margin: 10px 0; }
    .content { font-size: 16px; margin: 30px auto; width: 80%; text-align: left; line-height: 1.6; }
    .footer { margin-top: 60px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
    .signature { text-align: right; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="university"><%= universityName %></div>
  <div class="title">TRANSFER CERTIFICATE</div>

  <div class="content">
    This is to certify that <b><%= studentName %></b>, son/daughter of <b><%= parentName %></b>, 
    was a bonafide student of <b><%= collegeName %></b>.  
    He/She was admitted on <b><%= admissionDate %></b> and left the college on <b><%= leavingDate %></b>.  
    During his/her study, he/she pursued the <b><%= course %></b> course.  

    <br><br>
    This certificate is issued on <b><%= issueDate %></b> with Register No: <b><%= registerNo %></b>  
    and Transfer Certificate No: <b><%= tcNumber %></b>.
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <div>Seal</div>
    <div class="signature">Principal / Registrar</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
